    {
      "id": "github:295864168",
      "name": "VotingWorks VxSuite",
      "track": "open_source",
      "summary": "开源选举管理套件。VxHub 是 VotingWorks 托管的在线选举管理门户：官方文档说明其用于创建选举（标题、日期、类型、state/jurisdiction）、维护 districts、precincts/precinct splits、parties 与 contests，按 ballot style 预览/校对选票，并导出 election package、各版本 ballot PDF 与 test decks。VxAdmin 离线载入选举包并签名后供 VxPrint 等设备打印预生成选票；选举定义模型将 ballot style 绑定 precinct，并由关联 districts 决定所含 contests。VxHub 代码位于同一 vxsuite 仓库 apps/hub（后端包 license 字段为 GPL-3.0-only），仓库 README 声明所有文件 GPL v3.0 only。",
      "homepage": "https://voting.works",
      "repository_url": "https://github.com/votingworks/vxsuite",
      "github_repository_id": 295864168,
      "license": "GPL-3.0-only",
      "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/votingworks/vxsuite/main/LICENSE",
      "features": [
        "VxHub 在线选举管理：选举标题、日期、类型、state 与 jurisdiction",
        "district、precinct 与 precinct split、party、contest/ballot measure 的录入与编辑",
        "按 ballot style 预览和校对选票，支持音频校对与 finalize 锁定",
        "导出 election package、precinct/absentee 各版本 ballot PDF 与 test decks",
        "选举定义模型：ballot style 绑定 precinct，所含 contests 由关联 districts 决定",
        "VxAdmin 离线载入/签名选举包；VxPrint 按 precinct/split/party/language 打印预生成选票"
      ],
      "deployment": [
        "vendor-managed web service (VxHub)",
        "offline (VxAdmin, VxPrint)"
      ],
      "technology_stack": [
        "TypeScript",
        "Rust",
        "Node.js",
        "PostgreSQL"
      ],
